# ResideWell CFO Pricing & Metrics

Use conservative assumptions in every model and projection.

## Default assumptions

- Instructor cost per class: $65–$85
- Event facilitator cost: $200–$400
- Event supplies: $100–$300
- Monthly admin/reporting time per property: 2–4 hours
- Target gross margin: 45%+
- Minimum pilot price: $3,500 · Preferred: $4,000
- Standard annual package: $21,600/year

## Track

Properties contacted · contacts added · reply rate · discovery calls booked · proposals sent · pilots closed · pilot-to-annual conversion · monthly recurring revenue · gross margin · instructor reliability · attendance per class · resident satisfaction.

## Guardrails

Never price a pilot below $3,500. Discount with value (extra class or event), not rate cuts. Portfolio deals (3+ properties, same management company) are the only standing discount lever (10%).

Dashboard: `operations/weekly-execution-dashboard.md`. Pricing ladder: `proposal/annual-pricing-ladder.md`.
